    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap Native ICMP Protocol Engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Specifications:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RFC 792 Internet Control Message Protocol</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Zero dynamic memory allocation (0 bytes heap)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Types:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Type 0: Echo Reply</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Type 3: Destination Unreachable</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Type 8: Echo Request </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
